      ],
      "focus": [
        "everyday online tasks on production websites",
        "multi-step, write-heavy form workflows"
      ],
      "notes": "The README says two ASPCA tasks were removed after publication, so the shipped corpora hold 152 and 129 tasks while scoring.md still divides by 153 and 130. Live sites change over time, and the README asks for comparisons under the same corpus revision, harness and rubric. Agents run through selectable harnesses (for example Hermes and OpenClaw), so observations and actions depend on the harness.",
